xnu: 0191 vince Wi-Fi: NV download over the WLAN HAL before HAL_START

Mainline wcn36xx sends the NV again as WCN36XX_HAL_DOWNLOAD_NV_REQ (55) in
3072-byte fragments before HAL_START; without it HAL_START answered status
38 on every try (phone log with 0190). 0189 keeps the NV for this.

